## Summary
Tonino Lamborghini denies being the father of Flavia Borzone and rejects her paternity lawsuit, accusing her and her mother of seeking notoriety. He asserts his true family includes his five children.

## Key Points
- Tonino Lamborghini denies paternity of Flavia Borzone.
- Flavia Borzone and her mother Rosalba Colosimo are pursuing a legal case for paternity recognition.
- Lamborghini claims they are seeking fame and notoriety.
- He emphasizes his real family with five children.


